{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>I made a covenant</b> — as though I made a covenant with my eyes not to look at what I have no need for, and furthermore that I would not gaze at what I contemplate regarding a virgin. And those who look — what portion will come to them from on high, and what inheritance that Shaddai will give them."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:04.906177812Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}